\"priorFindingStatuses\":[],\"newFindings\":[{\"id\":\"S5-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"CLI pull/materialize stdout does not match the story contract\",\"evidence\":\"Story AC-5.5 and TC-5.4 require `view pull` to emit the JSON message array and `view materialize` to print the written path (`stories/05-render-targets.md:35-36`; `test-plan.md:47`). Production code instead routes both commands through `renderResult` (`src/cli/view.ts:140-141`, `src/cli/view.ts:172-186`), and `renderResult` serializes the full OpResult wrapper (`src/cli/render.ts:14-18`). A direct probe after build showed `node dist/cli.js view pull --file-path ... --json` printing `{ \\\"ok\\\": true, \\\"value\\\": { \\\"messages\\\": [], \\\"meta\\\": ... } }`, not a top-level array. The process test reinforces the wrong contract by parsing OpResult via `parseResult`/`expectOk` and then unwrapping `.value` (`test/cli-process-view.test.ts:58-65`, `test/cli-process-view.test.ts:156-164`, `test/cli-process-view.test.ts:178-181`).\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"packages/lhc/src/cli/view.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/cli/render.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/cli-process-view.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-5.5\",\"TC-5.4\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"blocking\":true}],\"openFindings\":[{\"id\":\"S5-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"CLI pull/materialize stdout does not match the story contract\",\"evidence\":\"Story AC-5.5 and TC-5.4 require `view pull` to emit the JSON message array and `view materialize` to print the written path (`stories/05-render-targets.md:35-36`; `test-plan.md:47`). Production code instead routes both commands through `renderResult` (`src/cli/view.ts:140-141`, `src/cli/view.ts:172-186`), and `renderResult` serializes the full OpResult wrapper (`src/cli/render.ts:14-18`). A direct probe after build showed `node dist/cli.js view pull --file-path ... --json` printing `{ \\\"ok\\\": true, \\\"value\\\": { \\\"messages\\\": [], \\\"meta\\\": ... } }`, not a top-level array. The process test reinforces the wrong contract by parsing OpResult via `parseResult`/`expectOk` and then unwrapping `.value` (`test/cli-process-view.test.ts:58-65`, `test/cli-process-view.test.ts:156-164`, `test/cli-process-view.test.ts:178-181`).\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"packages/lhc/src/cli/view.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/cli/render.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/cli-process-view.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-5.5\",\"TC-5.4\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"blocking\":true}],\"requirementCoverage\":{\"verified\":[\"AC-5.1 / TC-5.1: `view-render-targets.test.ts` verifies band messages in brief -> detailed -> smooth order, labels, tail record order, roles, and deterministic repeated pulls; covered by `pnpm run green-verify`.\",\"AC-5.2 / TC-5.2: `view-render-targets.test.ts` verifies materialize writes a PI-session file, repeats byte-identically, derives header/band fields from metadata, and leaves full thread state hash unchanged; covered by `pnpm run green-verify`.\",\"AC-5.3 / TC-5.2 / TC-5.5: `materialize.ts` renders from the shared assembled view entries, and `view-render-targets.test.ts` verifies item-for-item pull/file parity plus PI-session conformance and parentId chain; covered by `pnpm run green-verify`.\",\"AC-5.4 / TC-5.3: `view-render-targets.test.ts` verifies never-compacted materialize produces a valid tail-only file with header timestamp/id from thread metadata; covered by `pnpm run green-verify`.\",\"Format fixture DoD: `pi-session-structure.jsonl` exists with provenance in `pi-session-structure.provenance.md` identifying PI coding agent 0.79.1 and session format version 3.\",\"Process carry-over legs: `cli-process-view.test.ts` covers spawned sweep receipt parity, compact receipt parity, profile violation nonzero, missing-thread structured errors, zero-provider CLI env, and CLI intake boundary advance; covered by `pnpm run verify-all`.\"],\"unverified\":[\"AC-5.5 / TC-5.4 exact stdout contract: production `view pull` emits an OpResult object instead of the JSON message array, and `view materialize` emits an OpResult object containing `writtenPath` instead of printing the path.\"]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"productionPathFindings\":[\"S5-001: production CLI render path for `view pull` and `view materialize` returns the OpResult wrapper rather than the story-required top-level message array/path.\"],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"revise\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservations\":[\"No fake adapter, mock runtime path, placeholder branch, or provider-backed workaround was found in the Story 5 production render-target paths. Test fakes are confined to fixture/provider setup.\"]},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/05-render-targets/004-verify.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-06-11T18:10:07.430Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-06-11T18:14:35.018Z\"}\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/05-render-targets/003-implementor.json:1:{\"command\":\"story-implement\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"ok\",\"outcome\":\"ready-for-verification\",\"result\":{\"resultId\":\"b201ae85-ef12-4771-9369-c8ec08051289\",\"provider\":\"claude-code\",\"model\":\"claude-fable-5\",\"role\":\"story_implementor\",\"sessionId\":\"d96b6140-abf0-4148-ae10-52f37fa752e0\",\"continuation\":{\"provider\":\"claude-code\",\"sessionId\":\"d96b6140-abf0-4148-ae10-52f37fa752e0\",\"storyId\":\"05-render-targets\"},\"outcome\":\"ready-for-verification\",\"story\":{\"id\":\"05-render-targets\",\"title\":\"Story 5: Render Targets\"},\"planSummary\":\"Format fixture first: trimmed a real PI session file (PI 0.79.1, session version 3) into test/fixtures/pi-session-structure.jsonl with a provenance note, and a conformance helper that derives required shapes from the fixture at runtime. Then materialize over pull output: refactored the pull assembly in thread-view/index.ts into one shared assembleView() that both pull and materialize consume (parity by construction — internal/materialize.ts never sees a DB handle), with entry ids/timestamps derived from message ids, event recorded_at, and view created-at (never write-time clocks; tail rows now carry recorded_at via an event join, and thread_metadata feeds the header — the sanctioned fix-pull's-output path). Added the unknown_format caller error. Then cli/view.ts with the full pinned grammar (five commands, band-override flags merged field-wise before validation, --no-sweep, --json, --out, --format), routed ahead of the shared flag parser so its flags don't widen other commands. Finally the process suite: TC-5.4, parity legs for all five commands on twin fixture threads, the profile-violation and missing-thread nonzero legs, TC-3.3's CLI receipt-shape leg via the shared schema, and the CLI-intake-advances-boundary leg (spawned intake over default max → spawned pull shows abridged flips, spawned status zone ≤ target). Two hash-locked tests amended under the established sanctioned-amendment pattern (Story 2/3 precedent) with the manifest re-recorded.\",\"changedFiles\":[{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/shared/errors.ts\",\"reason\":\"new unknown_format caller-error code for materialize's format check (story Scope: unknown format names accepted values)\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/snapshot.ts\",\"reason\":\"tail rows gain recordedAt (event join) and readThreadMetadata() — materialize's generated fields derive from record/view metadata, never write-time clocks (AC-5.2)\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/materialize.ts\",\"reason\":\"new PI session JSONL writer: pure mapping from pull entries (header, parentId chain, text-block encoding) plus the file write; never sees a DB handle (must-not-own)\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/index.ts\",\"reason\":\"pull assembly extracted into shared assembleView(); materialize implemented over the same entry array (AC-5.3 parity structural), touch-suppressed, format-validated; stub and notImplemented helper removed\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/cli/view.ts\",\"reason\":\"new lhc view pull|status|compact|sweep|materialize adapter per the pinned grammar; calls the domain surface directly so no provider exists on the path\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/cli/index.ts\",\"reason\":\"routes the view group to its own parser (keeps view flags out of the shared flag set); help text gains the five commands\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/vitest.config.ts\",\"reason\":\"cli-process-view.test.ts added to the process-suite-only exclude list\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/fixtures/pi-session-structure.jsonl\",\"reason\":\"structure-trimmed REAL PI session file (anti-shim: from PI output, not the design's description)\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/fixtures/pi-session-structure.provenance.md\",\"reason\":\"provenance note: source session, PI coding agent 0.79.1 / session format v3, trim applied (DoD item)\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/fixtures/pi-session-format.ts\",\"reason\":\"conformance checker deriving header/entry/block shapes from the fixture at runtime (TC-5.3/TC-5.5), shared by both suites\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/fixtures/index.ts\",\"reason\":\"re-export the conformance helpers\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/view-render-targets.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"TC-5.1, TC-5.2 (+unknown-format leg), TC-5.3, TC-5.5 through the real SDK surface\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/cli-process-view.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"TC-5.4 plus all deferred process legs: five-command parity, profile-violation, missing-thread, TC-3.3 CLI receipt shape, CLI-intake-advances-boundary; every spawn strips LHC_PROVIDER\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/view-pull.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"sanctioned amendment: retired the materialize not-implemented skeleton test (the operation is real; view-render-targets owns it) — same pattern Stories 2/3 used\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/view-sweep.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"sanctioned amendment: zero-provider five-op test now expects materialize ok:true (still zero provider calls)\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/red-manifest.json\",\"reason\":\"re-recorded hashes for the two amended files; locked the two new test files\"}],\"tests\":{\"added\":[\"view-render-targets: TC-5.1 bands in gradient order with labels, tail in record order, byte-identical repeated pulls\",\"view-render-targets: TC-5.2 materialize/pull item-for-item parity, view-metadata-derived ids/timestamps, byte-identical repeat, full thread-state hash unchanged\",\"view-render-targets: unknown format rejected naming pi-session, nothing written\",\"view-render-targets: TC-5.3 never-compacted tail-only file, header from thread created-at, fixture-conformant\",\"view-render-targets: TC-5.5 conformance against the real-PI structure fixture incl. explicit parentId chain\",\"cli-process-view: spawned sweep receipt passes shared schema and equals SDK twin (TC-3.3 CLI leg)\",\"cli-process-view: spawned compact with band flags equals SDK twin receipt, embedded sweep included\",\"cli-process-view: profile violation exits nonzero naming the sum constraint\",\"cli-process-view: spawned pull/status JSON equal SDK reads of the same thread (TC-5.4)\",\"cli-process-view: spawned materialize prints path; file conforms and is byte-identical to the SDK's\",\"cli-process-view: unknown --format exits nonzero naming accepted values\",\"cli-process-view: missing thread exits nonzero with structured thread_not_found on all five commands\",\"cli-process-view: spawned CLI intake over max advances the boundary — pull shows flips, status zone ≤ target (Story 4 debt)\"],\"modified\":[\"view-pull.test.ts (sanctioned amendment: materialize stub test removed)\",\"view-sweep.test.ts (sanctioned amendment: materialize expectation flipped to ok:true in the zero-provider five-op test)\"],\"removed\":[\"view-pull: 'materialize returns ok:false not-implemented, never throws' (operation is real now)\"],\"totalAfterStory\":325,\"deltaFromPriorBaseline\":12},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"selfReview\":{\"passesRun\":0,\"findingsFixed\":[\"TC-5.3 initially expected 5 file entries; turn_end projects no message so the never-compacted thread renders 4 — assertion corrected with a comment explaining why\"],\"findingsSurfaced\":[\"Header id format (threadId:createdAt) and header cwd (thread file's directory) are deterministic choices the tech design does not pin beyond 'derives from thread id + view createdAt' and the cwd field's existence — both satisfy byte-identical repeats; flag if the PI extension expects a UUID-shaped id or a real cwd\",\"--json is accepted per the pinned grammar but is a no-op: output is always JSON per the Epic 01/02 CLI convention (documented in --help)\",\"user-role content is encoded as a text-block array (PI accepts both string and block array for user; assistant requires the array) — one uniform encoding keeps the writer simple\",\"Two Red-locked test files were amended and the manifest re-recorded, following the explicit sanctioned-amendment precedent from Stories 2 and 3\"]},\"openQuestions\":[],\"specDeviations\":[],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"Story verification: review the sanctioned amendments to view-pull/view-sweep and the header id/cwd derivation choices, then run the epic-level acceptance pass — this story closes the epic's last open debts (process suite now 'ran', Story 3 and Story 4 deferred legs green).\"},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/05-render-targets/003-implementor.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-06-11T17:50:41.274Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-06-11T18:09:57.008Z\"}\npackages/lhc/test/idempotency.test.ts:35:      .all() as unknown as Array<{ name: string }>;\npackages/lhc/test/idempotency.test.ts:131:        .all() as unknown as Array<{ idempotency_key: string; n: number | bigint }>;\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/05-render-targets/002-story-orchestrate-run.json:1:{\"command\":\"story-orchestrate run\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"ok\",\"outcome\":\"accepted\",\"result\":{\"case\":\"completed\",\"outcome\":\"accepted\",\"storyId\":\"05-render-targets\",\"storyRunId\":\"05-render-targets-story-run-001\",\"currentSnapshotPath\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/05-render-targets/story-lead/001-current.json\",\"eventHistoryPath\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/05-render-targets/story-lead/001-events.jsonl\",\"finalPackagePath\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/05-render-targets/story-lead/001-final-package.json\",\"finalPackage\":{\"outcome\":\"accepted\",\"storyRunId\":\"05-render-targets-story-run-001\",\"storyId\":\"05-render-targets\",\"attempt\":1,\"summary\":{\"storyTitle\":\"Story 5: Render Targets\",\"implementedScope\":\"Resolved verifier finding S5-001 only. In src/cli/view.ts, `view pull` now prints the message array itself as JSON on stdout on success (the AC-5.5/TC-5.4 contract: the array IS the product, not an OpResult envelope), and `view materialize` prints the written path itself on stdout. Both commands fall through to the existing renderResult on failure, so every failure case still exits nonzero with the structured OpResult error JSON (missing-thread and unknown-format legs unchanged and still passing). status, compact, and sweep are untouched and keep printing the SDK result JSON, preserving their parity coverage. The --help blurb names the two success-output exceptions. cli-process-view.test.ts now asserts the story contract directly: the pull parity leg and the CLI-advance leg parse stdout as a ViewMessage[] and compare it to the SDK pull's messages; the materialize leg asserts stdout.trim() equals the --out path before validating the file. Manifest hash re-recorded for the modified process test; both gates rerun green.\",\"acceptanceRationale\":\"Story-lead scoped acceptance is ready for impl-lead review and outer acceptance.\"},\"evidence\":{\"implementorArtifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"implementor-result\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/05-render-targets/003-implementor.json\",\"provenance\":\"current-run\"},{\"kind\":\"implementor-result\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/05-render-targets/005-continue.json\",\"provenance\":\"current-run\"}],\"selfReviewArtifacts\":[],\"verifierArtifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"verifier-result\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/05-render-targets/004-verify.json\",\"provenance\":\"current-run\"},{\"kind\":\"verifier-result\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/05-render-targets/006-verify.json\",\"provenance\":\"current-run\"}],\"quickFixArtifacts\":[],\"callerInputArtifacts\":[],\"gateRuns\":[{\"command\":\"pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}]},\"verification\":{\"finalVerifierOutcome\":\"pass\",\"findings\":[{\"id\":\"S5-001\",\"status\":\"fixed\",\"evidence\":[\"006-verify.json marks S5-