{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q3W54dTyPsBeNbkfhekkEk","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# pi-session-structure.jsonl — provenance\n2\t\n3\tStructure-trimmed from a **real** PI session file (story Anti-Shim\n4\tRequirements: the fixture must come from PI's own output, never hand-authored\n5\tfrom the design's description — its job is to catch the design being wrong\n6\tabout PI, which a design-derived fixture cannot).\n7\t\n8\t- **Source session:** `~/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-leemoore-code-pi-long-horizon-liminal-context--/2026-06-10T19-16-08-959Z_019eb2f6-a47f-75a3-b98a-8ed1174bc90c.jsonl`\n9\t- **Produced by:** PI coding agent `0.79.1` (repo-ref pin `406a2214aa1dce746a1902605daf04e6727349dc`), session format version `3` (`CURRENT_SESSION_VERSION` in `repo-ref/pi/packages/coding-agent/src/core/session-manager.ts`)\n10\t- **Trim applied:** header plus the first seven entries kept verbatim\n11\t  (covering the `session` header shape, non-message entry kinds, and one\n12\t  `message` entry per role — `user`, `assistant`, `toolResult`); every string\n13\t  value truncated to 100 characters. No keys added, removed, or reordered;\n14\t  no values invented — structure is exactly what PI wrote.\n15\t- **Consumed by:** `test/fixtures/pi-session-format.ts`, which derives the\n16\t  required header/entry shapes from this file at runtime for TC-5.3/TC-5.5\n17\t  conformance checks.\n18\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01JVfJF1EzgZaekjRcpXxggG","session_id":"8f35b3b6-f7a4-4d02-a9f9-b9315f787309","uuid":"f2c32a41-9eb6-40ac-82a0-4c07d7704c7e","timestamp":"2026-06-11T18:23:41.754Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Audit test-plan conformance"}
