{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Wx27BhnLxwzpgKNhqgBDeN","type":"tool_result","content":"102:describe(\"TC-1.1 (AC-1.2, AC-1.3): never-compacted thread pulls the full conversation in order; later intake appends\", () => {\n103:  it(\"carries both intake rounds in record order with tail-only meta\", async () => {\n150:describe(\"TC-1.2 (AC-1.1, AC-1.7): two pulls with nothing between are byte-identical and create no work or provider calls\", () => {\n151:  it(\"hashes identical, zero work rows created, provider double observes zero calls\", async () => {\n175:describe(\"tail mapping legs (architecture-risk): one named leg per message kind\", () => {\n201:  it(\"user_prompt: user role, text verbatim\", () => {\n205:  it(\"assistant_thinking: assistant role, fenced [thinking] block\", () => {\n212:  it(\"tool_call: assistant role, name marker plus deterministic arg rendering\", () => {\n219:  it(\"tool_result ahead of the boundary: user role, name marker plus full content\", () => {\n226:  it(\"runtime_note: user role, [runtime note] marker plus text\", () => {\n230:  it(\"assistant_text: assistant role, text verbatim\", () => {\n234:  it(\"tool_result at-or-behind the boundary: abridged marker plus short form (boundary seeded below-SDK)\", async () => {\n258:describe(\"TC-1.4 (AC-1.5): boundary mid-tail — short behind, full ahead, non-tool content full everywhere\", () => {\n259:  it(\"renders the ready summary behind the boundary and full content ahead of it\", async () => {\n324:  it(\"falls to deterministic truncation when no summary is ready and the content is oversized\", async () => {\n358:describe(\"TC-2.5 pre-compact legs (AC-2.8): the status read on a heavy thread\", () => {\n376:  it(\"reports tail tokens vs threshold, recommendation, derivation counts, null view health, and the zone sum — reads only\", async () => {\n416:  it(\"counts blocked forms through the owner's report (sacrificial sibling)\", async () => {\n427:  it(\"after more intake the tail grew; still no compact without invocation\", async () => {\n447:describe(\"TC-1.2 / TC-2.5 background legs (SV-01-PULL-STATUS-001): pull and status are reads-only in a background SDK with pending work queued\", () => {\n448:  it(\"schedules no catch-up drain: work rows, form states, provider count, and status all unchanged; repeated pulls byte-identical\", async () => {","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01JVfJF1EzgZaekjRcpXxggG","session_id":"8f35b3b6-f7a4-4d02-a9f9-b9315f787309","uuid":"fa7b0897-feeb-4422-9c49-9d833d0c8969","timestamp":"2026-06-11T18:24:14.934Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Audit test-plan conformance"}
